# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime data — NEVER commit.
#
# Deny-by-default rather than an allow-list of known filenames. This directory
# holds live logged-in browser sessions (equivalent to your passwords), your
# resume, the job database, and application screenshots. Listing files
# individually means any new artifact type silently becomes committable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/*
!data/.gitkeep

# Your personal facts and your approved answer bank.
config/profile.yaml
config/answers.yaml

